'''''Dataquest''''' is an Indian magazine focused on [[information technology]] related articles. The magazine is published monthly by Cyber Media India Ltd, [[South Asia]]'s largest specialty media group. It was one of the first publications to champion energy/green issues and the application of IT in governance.

==History and profile==
''Dataquest Magazine'' started as an industry publication in 1982 to address the information needs of the then nascent IT industry in India.<ref>{{cite web|title=DataQuest|url=http://digisub.ciol.com/DataQuest|work=Cyber Media|accessdate=26 December 2015|date=1 December 2015}}</ref> In the 1990s, it strengthened that position while broadening its coverage to include technology policies, markets and resellers.
Between 2008 and 2011, the magazine transformed itself to a complete publication on IT targeting the enterprise IT users such as CIOs and IT managers. That is also the period when the magazine saw significant research-based content.

The magazine runs two special sections on these two areas: Green IT<ref>{{Cite web |url=http://dqindia.ciol.com/content/GreenIT/default.asp |title=Green IT |access-date=30 May 2010 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20100527025926/http://dqindia.ciol.com/content/GreenIT/default.asp |archive-date=27 May 2010 |url-status=dead }}</ref> and eGovernance.<ref>{{Cite web |url=http://dqindia.ciol.com/content/egovernance/default.asp |title=eGovernance |access-date=30 May 2010 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20100504182347/http://dqindia.ciol.com/content/egovernance/default.asp |archive-date=4 May 2010 |url-status=dead }}</ref>

